{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finger Soccer is a button soccer game where you flick to score incredible goals from midfield! Choose from over 30 teams, compete in tournaments, penalty shootouts, and many more. Play solo or with friends, and become a finger football champion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509060/extras/2b8aba2f19dcc6c367f1ef365047572d.webp?t=1756733555\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509060/extras/f396da8b6cc2fac0168bd97a4589d746.poster.avif?t=1756733555\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509060/extras/f396da8b6cc2fac0168bd97a4589d746.webm?t=1756733555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509060/extras/f396da8b6cc2fac0168bd97a4589d746.mp4?t=1756733555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Finger Soccer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finger Soccer is a fast-paced button soccer game where you control the action with simple flicks to score amazing goals from midfield! Choose from over 30 teams, each with unique stats and play styles, and compete in exciting modes like tournaments, penalty shootouts, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509060/extras/e3093c8aa627da94d4e5f48d11e15729.webp?t=1756733555\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster